Package: wanglinux-tools
Version: 1.0.0-1~aurora1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: WangLinux Project <dev@wanglinux.example>
Installed-Size: 32
Depends: bash (>= 5.0), coreutils, sed, grep, apt, curl, ca-certificates
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/wanglinux/wanglinux
Description: WangLinux command-line toolbox
 A small set of WangLinux-specific administration commands:
  * wangfetch          — system info banner (pure POSIX sh, no extra deps)
  * wang-switch-mirror — one-command apt mirror switcher (USTC/TUNA/Aliyun/etc.)
  * wang-setup-server  — first-boot server hardening assistant
 .
 Works on any Debian 12+ base, with or without a desktop.
